+// whose danger_veto exceeds the least of {stay, free neighbours} by more than FLV_PCT % of my eff HP; with every step refused it
+// takes the least-veto tile (or stays). Bit 2 BAG: only while I carry a bag >= FLV_BAG. Hooks: combat.cpp flee_leave_reach (the
